* Topology for argon, krypton and xenon.
*
* NOT A CHARMM FILE. Split out of toppar_noble_gases_literature.str so it can be
* consumed by `read.rtf(path, append=True)` via MMML_CGENFF_EXTRA_RTF. The .str
* is a *stream* file -- it carries its own `read rtf card append` /
* `read para card flex append` directives -- which a direct RTF read cannot
* parse. The .str remains the file to `stream`; this one is the file to read.
*
* Provenance, parameters and caveats: see toppar_noble_gases_literature.str.
* The paired parameters are par_noble_gases_literature.prm.
*
* No version record here on purpose: a second version line under `append` is a
* CHARMM level-1 abort (see _rtf_path_for_append in nbonds_config.py, which
* strips one if present).

MASS  -1  AR        39.94800 AR ! argon
MASS  -1  KR        83.79800 KR ! krypton
MASS  -1  XE       131.29300 XE ! xenon

RESI AR1       0.00 ! argon
GROUP
ATOM AR01  AR  0.00
PATCHING FIRST NONE LAST NONE

RESI KR1       0.00 ! krypton
GROUP
ATOM KR01  KR  0.00
PATCHING FIRST NONE LAST NONE

RESI XE1       0.00 ! xenon
GROUP
ATOM XE01  XE  0.00
PATCHING FIRST NONE LAST NONE

END
